*** ch13-11-right-id — unification modulo right identity (Ur): counterpart to the left-id case (Maude manual §13.4.5)

mod RIGHTID-UNIFICATION-EX is
 sorts Magma Elem .
 subsorts Elem < Magma .
 op __ : Magma Magma -> Magma [gather (e E) right id: e] .
 ops a b c d e : -> Elem .
endm

*** manual writes "in RIGTHID-UNIFICATION-EX" here (typo); module is RIGHTID-UNIFICATION-EX
unify in RIGHTID-UNIFICATION-EX : X:Magma a =? Y:Magma a a .

unify in RIGHTID-UNIFICATION-EX : a X:Magma =? a a Y:Magma .

irredundant unify in RIGHTID-UNIFICATION-EX :
      a X:Magma =? a a Y:Magma .
